### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create Product
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "description": "Test Description",
  "stock_quantity": 100,
  "low_stock_threshold": 10
}

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products

